gglint parses Python with Ruff's parser (the ruff_python_parser, ruff_python_ast and
ruff_text_size crates), and its semantic model (src/semantic.rs) and walker
(src/checker.rs) are modelled on Ruff's ruff_python_semantic and ruff_linter crates.

Ruff: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff

